Subject: WS4 negative treatment offset retains the current fragment age

A negative treatment offset is the WS4 partial-cut sentinel: the fragment
keeps its current age instead of being reset to the offset. Apply from the
ws4 repository root with: git apply patches/ws4-negative-offset-retain.patch

--- a/ws4/sim/engine.py
+++ b/ws4/sim/engine.py
@@ -490,7 +490,8 @@
